---
description: Read browser/UI constraints before editing the vanilla frontend
globs: frontend/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Before adding or editing files under **`frontend/`** (including HTML/CSS/vanilla ES modules tied to this client), read **[`docs/web-client-guidelines.md`](docs/web-client-guidelines.md)** first, then:

- **[`docs/web-client-browser-constraints.md`](docs/web-client-browser-constraints.md)** — runtime, security, i18n, tunnels
- **[`docs/web-client-layout-contract.md`](docs/web-client-layout-contract.md)** — when changing shell layout

For user-visible chrome copy, extend **[`frontend/js/ui_strings.js`](frontend/js/ui_strings.js)** for **en / fr / es / pt / hi** rather than embedding English literals.
